# Copy to .env, which is gitignored and must stay that way.
#
# Read by tools/chronicle-art.sh alone, to paint one plate per version into
# docs/art/ - once each, never again. Without them the book builds exactly as
# it always did, with the drawn field and no plate, and nobody is told off.
#
# The token needs one permission: Account > Workers AI > Read.
#   https://dash.cloudflare.com/profile/api-tokens
# The account id is on the right-hand side of any zone's overview page.

CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=
CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=cfat_
